    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12387926/comment/12565980",
          "id": "12565980",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=cschmidt",
            "name": "cschmidt",
            "key": "cschmidt",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Chris Schmidt",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "I have an implementation that I can include for this issue, but it also includes tablespace (for Oracle) and filegroup (for SqlServer) support. If those enhancements are OK to include, I will attach the patch.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=cschmidt",
            "name": "cschmidt",
            "key": "cschmidt",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Chris Schmidt",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2008-02-06T01:07:19.175+0000",
          "updated": "2008-02-06T01:07:19.175+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12387926/comment/12565982",
          "id": "12565982",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=cschmidt",
            "name": "cschmidt",
            "key": "cschmidt",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Chris Schmidt",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "More of a refactoring request, but could the code that handles DB interaction be extracted to a common utility class (or set of classes)?  The current implementation violates the DRY principle and could cause additional maintenance issues in the future.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=cschmidt",
            "name": "cschmidt",
            "key": "cschmidt",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Chris Schmidt",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2008-02-06T01:10:37.245+0000",
          "updated": "2008-02-06T01:10:37.245+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12387926/comment/12621381",
          "id": "12621381",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=martijnh",
            "name": "martijnh",
            "key": "martijnh",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Martijn Hendriks",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "The Oracle tablespace and SqlServer filegroup support have already been added (see JCR-968 and JCR-1295). The attached patch solves this issue.\n\nI agree with Chris that we should very probably think about refactoring all or most of the DB interaction into a set of utility classes. The fact that this Oracle issue has popped up three times for different parts of the code (this issue, JCR-814 and JCR-582) underlines the lurking maintenance problems.\n\n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=martijnh",
            "name": "martijnh",
            "key": "martijnh",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Martijn Hendriks",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2008-08-11T08:27:23.312+0000",
          "updated": "2008-08-11T08:27:23.312+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12387926/comment/12623278",
